{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7Jq9UBo4Li/", "status": "success", "summary": {"http": 200, "seconds": 0.1, "name": "Limoncello Spritz", "n_ingredients": 6, "n_steps": 5, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision", "cached": true, "sample_ingredients": ["4 cl Limoncello", "20 cl Prosecco", "dash Dash of soda"], "sample_steps": ["Step 1: Fill a glass with ice.", "Step 2: Pour in 4 cl of Limoncello."]}, "full_response": {"cached": true, "extraction": {"confidence": 0.5, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision"}, "language": "en", "meta": {"description": "This is the perfect Drink to feel the vibes of the Italian summer 🇮🇹☀️\nSweet and refreshing: Limoncello Spritz🍋\n\n➡️Ingredients:\n\nLimoncello 4 cl\nProsecco 20 cl \nDash of soda \nICE qb\nGarnish it with lemon slice and mint 🌿🍸🍋 \n\nWhat is your favorite summer drink? \nTag someone who must take you to Positano! 🥰🍋🇮🇹 \n\n#limoncello  #lemon #prosecco #limoncellospritz #spritz #cocktails #drinks #mixologist #italia #italy #italiansummer #summer #positano #amalfi #amalficoast #cocktailrecipes #italianstyle #ladolcevita\n\nVideo by italy_alfresco", "duration": 54.81999969482422, "extractor": "Instagram", "language": "en", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "thumbnail": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2F0140ee60a6c24522aa9dee181e575767.jpg?alt=media", "title": "Video by italy_alfresco", "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7Jq9UBo4Li"}, "recipe": {"cook_time": "0 mins", "cuisine": "Italian", "description": "vegetarian vegan low carb gluten free balanced Limoncello Spritz.", "diet_flags": ["Vegetarian", "Vegan", "Low Carb", "Gluten Free", "Balanced"], "ingredients": [{"name": "Limoncello", "quantity": "4 cl"}, {"name": "Prosecco", "quantity": "20 cl"}, {"name": "Dash of soda", "quantity": "dash"}, {"name": "ICE", "quantity": "qb"}, {"name": "Lemon slice", "quantity": "for garnish"}, {"name": "Mint", "quantity": "for garnish"}], "i