{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbHSyCqv_Zw/", "status": "success", "summary": {"http": 200, "seconds": 13.6, "name": "Sticky Garlic Beef Spring Rolls with Spicy Peanut Sauce", "n_ingredients": 21, "n_steps": 9, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision", "cached": false, "sample_ingredients": ["for cooking Avocado oil spray", "1 lb 93% lean Ground beef", "@spicexseasoning (SPG)"], "sample_steps": ["Step 1: Spray a pan with avocado oil and heat it.", "Step 2: Add ground beef and cook until browned."]}, "full_response": {"extraction": {"confidence": 0.5, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision"}, "language": "en", "meta": {"description": "SAVE THIS ‼️Sticky Garlic Beef Spring ROLLS with a low cal Spicy Peanut Sauce 🤯 (recipe 👇🏽) \n\nIB: @smaller_sam.pcos \n\nAnnouncements:\n✅ Want to lose weight without eating bland boring food? My digital cookbooks include 180+ high-protein recipes with calories and macros included and are 50% off rn and ! Grab yours on my website today 😊\n✅ OR Comment “cookbook” and I’ll send you the link! (Macros and Calories Included) 💪🏽\n✅ I developed new seasonings for everyday cooking! @spicexseasoning OUT now! 👀 \n\nPer spring roll + sauce included (makes x4): 313 calories | 29g P | 25g C | 8g F\n\nFor the beef:\nAvocado oil spray, for cooking 🥑 \n1lb 93% lean Ground beef 🥩 \n@spicexseasoning (SPG)🧄 \n4-5 cloves Minced garlic 🧄 \n1 tsp Minced ginger 🫚 \n4 tbsp brown sugar\n3 tbsp soy sauce GF\n1 tsp sesame oil \n2-3 bunches Green onion chopped\n\n🥣 Peanut Dipping Sauce\n26g PB2 powdered peanut butter 🥜 \n30g Teriyaki Marinade \n1 tbsp soy sauce\n1-2 tbsp sriracha (adjust to taste) 🌶️ \n1/4 cup water 💦 \n2 clove minced garlic 🧄 \nOptional: 1 tsp chili crunch oil \n\nTo wrap it up:\n8 Rice papers\nButter lettuce\nShredded careots \nShredded Purple Cabbage \nCucumbers cut into match sticks \n\nIf you want weekly recipes and discounts straight to your email inbox every Sunday then comment “newsletter” 😌📧\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#icekarim #healthyrecipes #easyrecipes #mealprep #quickrecipes\n\nVideo by ice.karimcooks", "duration": 35.20000076293945, "extractor": "Instagram", "language": "en", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "thumbnail": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2F3aa9a41f4fea44c3a451399bc66acd4c.jpg?alt=media", "title": "Video by ice.karimcooks", "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbHSyCqv_Zw"}, "recipe": {"cook_time": "10 minutes", "cuisine": "American", "description": "high protein high fiber gluten free balanced Sticky Garlic Beef Spring Rolls with Spicy Peanut Sauce.", "diet_flags": ["High Protein", "High Fiber", "Gluten Free", "Balanced"], "ingredients": [{"name": "Avocado oil spray", "quantity": "for cooking"}, {"name": "93% lean Ground beef", "quantity": "1 lb"}, {"name": "@spicexseasoning (SPG)", "quantity": ""}, {"name": "Minced garlic", "quantity": "4-5 cloves"}, {"name": "Minced ginger", "quantity": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Brown sugar", "quantity": "4 tbsp"}, {"name": "Soy sauce GF", "quantity": "3 tbsp"}, {"name": "Sesame oil", "quantity": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Green onion", "quantity": "2-3 bunches chopped"}, {"name": "PB2 powdered peanut butter", "quantity": "26 g"}, {"name": "Teriyaki Marinade", "quantity": "30 g"}, {"name": "Soy sauce", "quantity": "1 tbsp"}, {"name": "Sriracha", "quantity": "1-2 tbsp (adjust to taste)"}, {"name": "Water", "quantity": "1/4 cup"}, {"name": "Minced garlic", "quantity": "2 cloves"}, {"name": "Chili crunch oil", "quantity": "1 tsp (optional)"}, {"name": "Rice papers", "quantity": "8"}, {"name": "Butter lettuce", "quantity": "to taste"}, {"name": "Shredded carrots", "quantity": "to taste"}, {"name": "Shredded Purple Cabbage", "quantity": "to taste"}, {"name": "Cucumbers", "quantity": "cut into match sticks"}], "instructions": ["Step 1: Spray a pan with avocado oil and heat it.", "Step 2: Add ground beef and cook until browned.", "Step 3: Stir in spice seasoning, minced garlic, and minced ginger.", "Step 4: Add brown sugar, soy sauce, sesame oil, and chopped green onion. Mix well.", "Step 5: In a bowl, combine PB2, teriyaki marinade, soy sauce, sriracha, water, and minced garlic to make the peanut sauce.", "Step 6: Soak rice papers in warm water until soft.", "Step 7: Place butter lettuce, cooked beef mixture, shredded carrots, shredded purple cabbage, and cucumbers on the rice paper.", "Step 8: Roll the rice paper tightly around the filling.", "Step 9: Serve with spicy peanut sauce."], "meal_type": "Lunch", "name": "Sticky Garlic Beef Spring Rolls with Spicy Peanut Sauce", "notes": ["Per spring roll + sauce included (makes x4): 313 calories | 29g protein | 25g carbs | 8g fat"], "nutrition": {"calcium_mg": "50", "calories": "313", "carbs_g": "25", "cholesterol_mg": "70", "fat_g": "8", "fiber_g": "3", "iron_mg": "3", "potassium_mg": "600", "protein_g": "29", "saturated_fat_g": "4", "sodium_mg": "800", "sugar_g": "5", "vitamin_a_mcg": "500", "vitamin_c_mg": "10", "vitamin_d_mcg": "0"}, "prep_time": "15 minutes", "servings": "4", "total_time": "25 minutes"}, "source": {"image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2F3aa9a41f4fea44c3a451399bc66acd4c.jpg?alt=media", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "source_type": "Instagram", "title": "Video by ice.karimcooks", "type": "video", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DbHSyCqv_Zw"}, "tags": ["High Protein", "Medium"], "transcript": null}}
{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Daf4SV6vWUH/", "status": "failure", "summary": {"http": 200, "seconds": 16.1, "name": "Grilled Chicken Avocado Corn Salad with Chili-Lime Dressing", "n_ingredients": 18, "n_steps": 0, "method": "caption_llm_partial", "cached": false, "missing": ["instructions"], "warnings": ["No instructions found in the caption or video."], "sample_ingredients": ["Boneless skinless chicken thighs", "Corn", "Mini cucumbers"], "sample_steps": [], "reason": "no steps"}, "full_response": {"extraction": {"confidence": 0.5, "method": "caption_llm_partial"}, "language": "en", "meta": {"description": "GRILLED CHICKEN AVOCADO CORN SALAD with CHILI-LIME DRESSING🌽🥑\n\nEasy✔️ Healthy✔️ And bursting with summer flavors!✔️ This protein-packed salad is my new favorite summer meal! Made with juicy grilled chicken, sweet corn, creamy avocado + fresh herbs all tossed in a tangy chili-lime dressing. It’s perfect for weeknight dinners, meal-prepped lunches or anytime you’re craving something fresh & delicious.👌🏻\n\nComment “Recipe” below⬇️ & I’ll send you the full recipe.\n\nOR click the link in my bio⬆️ & search “Grilled Chicken Avocado Corn Salad” in the search bar.\n\nWhat you’ll need for the salad:\nBoneless skinless chicken thighs\nCorn\nMini cucumbers\nAvocado\nCilantro\nFresh basil\nGreen onion\nChili powder\nSmoked paprika\nCumin\nGarlic powder\nSalt\nBlack pepper\nOlive oil, for the chicken\n\nWhat you’ll need for the dressing:\nLime juice\nOlive oil\nRed pepper flakes\nSalt\n\n#chickensalad #highprotein #easymeals #healthymeals #easyrecipes\n\nVideo by kalefornia_kravings", "duration": 25.238000869750977, "extractor": "Instagram", "language": "en", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "thumbnail": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2F4981495e884543eda03490e2537ecab6.jpg?alt=media", "title": "Video by kalefornia_kravings", "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Daf4SV6vWUH"}, "recipe"