{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dcz1OHUKGiC/", "status": "success", "summary": {"http": 200, "seconds": 6.2, "name": "Butter Chicken", "n_ingredients": 22, "n_steps": 11, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision", "cached": false, "sample_ingredients": ["2lb cubed chicken thighs", "1tbsp grated garlic", "1tbsp grated ginger"], "sample_steps": ["Step 1: In a bowl, combine cubed chicken thighs, grated garlic, grated ginger, Whole Fat Yogurt, and lemon juice. Mix we", "Step 2: In a separate bowl, mix paprika, turmeric, cumin, cayenne, chili powder, salt, and garam masala to create the sp"]}, "full_response": {"extraction": {"confidence": 0.5, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision"}, "language": "en", "meta": {"description": "Butter Chicken🇮🇳\n\nIngredients:\n\n2lb of cubed chicken thighs \n1tbsp grated garlic\n1tbsp grated ginger\n2-3 tbsp Whole Fat Yogurt\nJuice from one lemon\n\nHomemade spice mix:\n\n1/2tsp paprika\n1/2tsp turmeric\n1tsp cumin\n1tsp cayenne\n1tsp chili powder\n1 tsp Salt\n2 tsp garam masala\n\nSauce:\n1tbsp butter + 1tbsp oil OR 2tbsp Ghee\n1 diced onion\n1tbsp garlic\n1/2tbsp ginger\n1/2tsp Garam masala\n1/2tsp coriander\n1/2tsp cumin\n1 cup plain tomato sauce, canned tomatoes, or crushed tomatoes. \n1 cup heavy cream\n\nAdd sugar to taste to balance out the tanginess from tomatoes\n\n#butterchicken #indianfood\n\nVideo by jclacooks", "duration": 60.29999923706055, "extractor": "Instagram", "language": "en", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "thumbnail": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2Fa8bbd4fed07b45fdace4472cb4c91b9e.jpg?alt=media", "title": "Video by jclacooks", "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dcz1OHUKGiC"}, "recipe": {"cook_time": "30 minutes", "cuisine": "Indian", "description": "high protein low carb keto gluten free balanced Butter Chicken.", "diet_flags": ["High Protein", "Low Carb", "Keto", "Gluten Free", "Balanced"], "ingredients": [{"name": "cubed chicken thighs", "quantity": "2lb"}, {"name": "grated garlic", "quantity": "1tbsp"}, {"name": "grated ginger", "quantity": "1tbsp"}, {"name": "Whole Fat Yogurt", "quantity": "2-3 tbsp"}, {"name": "lemon juice", "quantity": "Juice from one lemon"}, {"name": "paprika", "quantity": "1/2tsp"}, {"name": "turmeric", "quantity": "1/2tsp"}, {"name": "cumin", "quantity": "1tsp"}, {"name": "cayenne", "quantity": "1tsp"}, {"name": "chili powder", "quantity": "1tsp"}, {"name": "Salt", "quantity": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "garam masala", "quantity": "2 tsp"}, {"name": "butter + oil OR Ghee", "quantity": "1tbsp butter + 1tbsp oil OR 2tbsp Ghee"}, {"name": "diced onion", "quantity": "1"}, {"name": "garlic", "quantity": "1tbsp"}, {"name": "ginger", "quantity": "1/2tbsp"}, {"name": "Garam masala", "quantity": "1/2tsp"}, {"name": "coriander", "quantity": "1/2tsp"}, {"name": "cumin", "quantity": "1/2tsp"}, {"name": "plain tomato sauce, canned tomatoes, or crushed tomatoes", "quantity": "1 cup"}, {"name": "heavy cream", "quantity": "1 cup"}, {"name": "sugar", "quantity": "to taste"}], "instructions": ["Step 1: In a bowl, combine cubed chicken thighs, grated garlic, grated ginger, Whole Fat Yogurt, and lemon juice. Mix well.", "Step 2: In a separate bowl, mix paprika, turmeric, cumin, cayenne, chili powder, salt, and garam masala to create the spice mix.", "Step 3: Add the spice mix to the chicken mixture and marinate for at least 30 minutes.", "Step 4: In a pan, heat butter and oil (or ghee) over medium heat.", "Step 5: Add diced onion and sauté until translucent.", "Step 6: Add garlic and ginger, and cook for another minute.", "Step 7: Stir in garam masala, coriander, and cumin, and cook for a minute until fragrant.", "Step 8: Add the marinated chicken to the pan and cook until browned.", "Step 9: Pour in the tomato sauce and bring to a simmer.", "Step 10: Stir in heavy cream and cook until the sauce thickens.", "Step 11: Add sugar to taste to balance the tanginess from the tomatoes."], "meal_type": "Dinner", "name": "Butter Chicken", "notes": ["Add sugar to taste to balance out the tanginess from tomatoes"], "nutrition": {"calcium_mg": "100", "calories": "450", "carbs_g": "10", "cholesterol_mg": "120", "fat_g": "30", "fiber_g": "2", "iron_mg": "3", "potassium_mg": "600", "protein_g": "35", "saturated_fat_g": "15", "sodium_mg": "600", "sugar_g": "5", "vitamin_a_mcg": "300", "vitamin_c_mg": "10", "vitamin_d_mcg": "1"}, "prep_time": "30 minutes", "servings": "4", "total_time": "1 hour"}, "source": {"image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2Fa8bbd4fed07b45fdace4472cb4c91b9e.jpg?alt=media", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "source_type": "Instagram", "title": "Video by jclacooks", "type": "video", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dcz1OHUKGiC"}, "tags": ["High Protein", "Medium"], "transcript": null}}
{"url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdHPaEexMaj/", "status": "success", "summary": {"http": 200, "seconds": 7.5, "name": "One Pan Roasted Garlic Salmon Pasta", "n_ingredients": 15, "n_steps": 8, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision", "cached": false, "sample_ingredients": ["2 large, about 8-10oz each salmon fillets", "12 oz dry protein pasta", "8 oz light cream cheese"], "sample_steps": ["Preheat the oven and prepare a baking dish with light cooking spray.", "Place the salmon fillets in the dish and surround them with cherry or grape tomatoes."]}, "full_response": {"extraction": {"confidence": 0.5, "method": "caption_llm+video_frames_vision"}, "language": "en", "meta": {"description": "This one pan Roasted garlic salmon pasta is insane🔥⬇️\n\n✅If you want access to 225+ recipes like this comment “cookbook”\n\nIngredients\n* 2 large salmon fillets, about 8-10oz each\n* 12 oz dry protein pasta\n* 8 oz light cream cheese\n* 2 pints cherry or grape tomatoes\n* 5 cloves garlic, minced\n* 2 tsp Italian seasoning\n* 1 tsp garlic powder\n* 1 tsp salt\n* ½ tsp black pepper\n* Light cooking spray\n* ½ cup fresh basil, chopped\n* ½ cup reserved pasta water, as needed\n\nOptional\n* Grated Parmesan\n* Red pepper flakes\n* Extra fresh basil\n\nMakes 4 large servings or 6 medium sized servings \n\nMacros Per Serving (6 servings)\n527 Calories\n35g Protein\n45g Carbs\n23g Fat\n\nMacros based on four 5.5 oz salmon fillets \n\n#highprotein #lowcalorie #recipe #easytomake\n\nVideo by hunt4shredz", "duration": 19.56599998474121, "extractor": "Instagram", "language": "en", "provider": "www.instagram.com", "thumbnail": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2Fc93d193a062a4a40a36d1358723ed6ea.jpg?alt=media", "title": "Video by hunt4shredz", "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdHPaEexMaj"}, "recipe": {"cook_time": "25 mins", "cuisine": "American", "description": "high protein low carb keto balanced One Pan Roasted Garlic Salmon Pasta.", "diet_flags": ["High Protein", "Low Carb", "Keto", "Balanced"], "ingredients": [{"name": "salmon fillets", "quantity": "2 large, about 8-10oz each"}, {"name": "dry protein pasta", "quantity": "12 oz"}, {"name": "light cream cheese", "quantity": "8 oz"}, {"name": "cherry or grape tomatoes", "quantity": "2 pints"}, {"name": "garlic, minced", "quantity": "5 cloves"}, {"name": "Italian seasoning", "quantity": "2 tsp"}, {"name": "garlic powder", "quantity": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "salt", "quantity": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "black pepper", "quantity": "½ tsp"}, {"name": "light cooking spray", "quantity": "as needed"}, {"name": "fresh basil, chopped", "quantity": "½ cup"}, {"name": "reserved pasta water", "quantity": "½ cup, as needed"}, {"name": "grated Parmesan", "quantity": "optional"}, {"name": "red pepper flakes", "quantity": "optional"}, {"name": "extra fresh basil", "quantity": "optional"}], "instructions": ["Preheat the oven and prepare a baking dish with light cooking spray.", "Place the salmon fillets in the dish and surround them with cherry or grape tomatoes.", "Add minced garlic, light cream cheese, Italian seasoning, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper to the dish.", "Bake until the salmon is cooked through and the tomatoes are blistered.", "Cook the protein pasta according to package instructions.", "Combine the cooked pasta with the salmon and tomato mixture.", "Add chopped fresh basil and reserved pasta water as needed to achieve desired consistency.", "Serve with optional grated Parmesan, red pepper flakes, and extra fresh basil."], "meal_type": "Dinner", "name": "One Pan Roasted Garlic Salmon Pasta", "notes": [], "nutrition": {"calcium_mg": "150", "calories": "527", "carbs_g": "45", "cholesterol_mg": "70", "fat_g": "23", "fiber_g": "4", "iron_mg": "2", "potassium_mg": "800", "protein_g": "35", "saturated_fat_g": "5", "sodium_mg": "600", "sugar_g": "3", "vitamin_a_mcg": "300", "vitamin_c_mg": "15", "vitamin_d_mcg": "10"}, "prep_tim