talian seasoning, chili flakes, salt, and pepper. Cook for 5 minutes, until fragrant.2.  Add the broth, canned tomatoes, and chicken. Simmer over medium heat for 20 minutes, until the chicken is cooked through. Shred the chicken. 3. Stir in the spinach, sun-dried tomatoes, and gnocchi. Add 1 cup of water. Cook for 2 minutes. Stir in the milk and both cheeses. 4. Ladle the soup into bowls. Top with bacon and rosemary. Enjoy, preferably with a crusty piece of bread."], "meal_type": "Lunch / Dinner", "name": "Italian Chicken Gnocchi Soup", "nutrition": {"calcium_mg": "250", "calories": "559", "carbs_g": "40", "cholesterol_mg": "80", "fat_g": "20", "fiber_g": "3", "iron_mg": "2", "potassium_mg": "800", "protein_g": "30", "saturated_fat_g": "10", "sodium_mg": "900", "sugar_g": "5", "vitamin_a_mcg": "800", "vitamin_c_mg": "60", "vitamin_d_mcg": "0"}, "prep_time": "25 mins", "servings": "6", "total_time": "50 mins"}, "source": {"image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/meal-plan-chef.firebasestorage.app/o/recipe-extract-img%2Ffbcc366c0a7243f6ba07e654379fbf21.jpg?alt=media", "provider": "www.halfbakedharvest.com", "source_type": "Manual", "title": "Italian Chicken Gnocchi Soup", "type": "webpage", "url": "https://www.halfbakedharvest.com/italian-chicken-gnocchi-soup/"}, "tags": ["High Protein", "Easy"], "transcript": null}}
